  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Whole organism; not skull-only, not movie creature. [\"Exact external crest contour, keratin cover, skin, colour and pose remain inferred. Do not present fossil breakage as crest serration.\", \"Holotype contains incomplete and restored bones; composite specimen reference is disclosed.\", \"Simplified complete-body dimensions other than approximate total length are artistic, not fossil measurements.\"] {\"length_m\": 6.0, \"basis\": \"UT research summary up to 20 feet (~6.1 m). Chosen artistic adult length, not measured complete holotype.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Whole organism; not skull-only, not movie creature. [\"Exact external crest contour, keratin cover, skin, colour and pose remain inferred. Do not present fossil breakage as crest serration.\", \"Holotype contains incomplete and restored bones; composite specimen reference is disclosed.\", \"Simplified complete-body dimensions other than approximate total length are artistic, not fossil measurements.\"] {\"length_m\": 6.0, \"basis\": \"UT research summary up to 20 feet (~6.1 m). Chosen artistic adult length, not measured complete holotype.\"}"
